jiyi is a DeepSeek Harness desktop plugin.

Its memory layout and product loop (topics, observation inbox, generated
MEMORY.md index, post-turn capture, later consolidation) are inspired by
the Apache-2.0 Grok Build project:

  https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build

This plugin does not copy Grok Build source. It is an independent
JavaScript implementation for the DSH desktop plugin host.
